 "cards": [
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "simon-sinek",
   "round": 1,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "We say we exist to give owners their time back. A done-for-you workforce proves that only if a small group feels it first."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "td-jakes",
   "round": 1,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "A",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "Clients already sense they cannot keep up alone. Name that out loud and move now, before a competitor names it for us."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "oprah-winfrey",
   "round": 1,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "Ten clients who truly feel seen teach us more than a hundred who just receive a login. Start where the care can be real."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "tiffany-aliche",
   "round": 1,
   "stance": "conditional",
   "preferred_option_id": "C",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "At $2,500 a month a client commits $30,000 a year. If we cannot show payback within a quarter, we are asking them to risk their foundation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "russell-brunson",
   "round": 1,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "A",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "The offer is the product. Put it in front of everyone in January with a clear promise, a clear price and one obvious next step."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "michelle-obama",
   "round": 1,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "Lead with the people it affects. A pilot lets clients help shape this, and that earns trust a launch cannot buy."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "brene-brown",
   "round": 1,
   "stance": "conditional",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "Tell clients plainly what the workforce will and will not do. Trust breaks when the promise is bigger than the delivery."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "dennis-kimbro",
   "round": 1,
   "stance": "conditional",
   "preferred_option_id": "D",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "Own the outcome. A money-back guarantee shows we build lasting capability for clients, not just more activity."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "les-brown",
   "round": 1,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "A",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "Do not wait for perfect. The only real obstacle is the fear of starting, so launch to everyone and learn fast."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "simon-sinek",
   "round": 2,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "The fault line is capacity versus promise. A pilot keeps our promise honest and protects why we exist."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "td-jakes",
   "round": 2,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "I challenged the idea that big means bold. Ten clients, loudly celebrated, is the bolder story to tell."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "oprah-winfrey",
   "round": 2,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "Ask each pilot client what changed in their week. Those answers will carry the larger launch."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "tiffany-aliche",
   "round": 2,
   "stance": "conditional",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "I move to the pilot, with a cap on our own delivery cost. If cost per client rises past plan, we pause."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "russell-brunson",
   "round": 2,
   "stance": "conditional",
   "preferred_option_id": "D",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "A pilot is slow. If we pilot, the guarantee must be on the offer from day one, or conversion will stall."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "michelle-obama",
   "round": 2,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "Choose the ten with care and tell the others when their turn comes. Integrity is in how we handle the waiting list."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "brene-brown",
   "round": 2,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "Name the hard part now: we may not be ready for more than ten. Saying that out loud is the trustworthy move."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "dennis-kimbro",
   "round": 2,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "Pick pilot clients who will own the result. Ownership, not enthusiasm, predicts who builds lasting value."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "advisor",
   "seat_id": "les-brown",
   "round": 2,
   "stance": "conditional",
   "preferred_option_id": "A",
   "decisive_arguments": [
    "I still say go big, but I accept a pilot if it has a date. A pilot with no end date is just a delay."
   ]
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "ratification",
   "seat_id": "simon-sinek",
   "round": 3,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "resolution_stance": "support",
   "unresolved_objections": [
    "Put the reason for the pilot in writing for clients: to earn their time back, not to test them."
   ],
   "amendments": []
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "ratification",
   "seat_id": "td-jakes",
   "round": 3,
   "stance": "support",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "resolution_stance": "support",
   "unresolved_objections": [
    "Tell the story of the pilot publicly so it reads as momentum, not hesitation."
   ],
   "amendments": []
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "ratification",
   "seat_id": "oprah-winfrey",
   "round": 3,
   "stance": "conditional",
   "preferred_option_id": "B",
   "resolution_stance": "conditional_support",
   "unresolved_objections": [
    "Set a check-in with each pilot client at 30 days, not only at the end."
   ],
   "amendments": []
  },
  {
   "card_kind": "ratification",
   "seat_id": "tiffany-aliche",
   "round": 3,
